roof-height envelope. Missing perimeter strips are restored against the source footprint supplied to Roofer, simplified by 0.15 m. Original Roofer geometry is retained separately in baseline/.","Astra replaces the planar Roofer roof approximation with a locally fitted quadratic shell using only classified roof returns within 3 m of Roofer roof surfaces. Reserved 10 m cells are excluded from the curve fit; Roofer used the full cloud, so this is held-out refinement validation, not an independent end-to-end survey.","The 1991 inspected photograph supports a thin white shell and gridded structural glazing. Shell thickness 0.65 m, glazing setback 2 m and simplified frame spacing are visual inferences, not LiDAR measurements; modern doors, lettering and interiors are not reconstructed.","Z=0 is the robust 62.3205 m IGN69 surrounding plaza datum. Below-plaza geometry is clipped to map ground, not a claim that the varying road/plaza terrain or hidden foundations are flat. Heights are not rescaled to the old OSM 50 m tag."],"source":{"url":"/objects/5990772fc9b9ba98668a22b46d26f2c6691c6d54cd3fa10d7f86ce7068bd91c4/source.blend.gz","bytes":170690,"sha256":"5990772fc9b9ba98668a22b46d26f2c6691c6d54cd3fa10d7f86ce7068bd91c4"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/43bc5bb537581658c0ddab908d0f5a2ad723f723b388e4b38cf6ecf772db7890/spatial-source.json","bytes":35740,"sha256":"43bc5bb537581658c0ddab908d0f5a2ad723f723b388e4b38cf6ecf772db7890"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/23295c893770ab884f7150c3a3d851555dd27ef13950b2b5498fce1742f5b4b0/preview.webp","bytes":5352,"sha256":"23295c893770ab884f7150c3a3d851555dd27ef13950b2b5498fce1742f5b4b0"},"revision":"97b01eb59b084f35fd72588451c460e0f95d2e2abcc0a29ee4bd09e0a02f6824","publicationRevision":"2294a0c9f8fae5841b1599c796313dfd2e7c8d0da188b5bab208399f64ed417b","bounds":[2.2378005,48.8918184,2.2404587,48.893752],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"3b5a90bef8f8d24f4a3e0370016ca377b424f60119e8245e165cbcc5e7ea53ef","url":"/materi